<!-- ────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 1: CAPABILITY COMPARISON
  ──────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="sect"><h2><span class="num">1</span> 能力对比：Open Design vs 谨迹</h2><p>聚焦三个子系统：流式解析、沙盒预览、模板渲染</p></div>

